cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "Chlamydomonas Flagella Holding Segmentation Dataset"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-17"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lucien-6/Chlamydomonas-Flagella-Holding-Dataset"
authors:
  - family-names: Lucien
    email: lucien-6@qq.com
    affiliation: "University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)"
    city: Chengdu
    country: CN
abstract: >-
  Manually annotated grayscale microscopy images and instance masks of
  Chlamydomonas reinhardtii (strain CC125) flagella recorded while the cell
  body was immobilized by a microneedle. The release contains 6,972
  image–mask pairs (400 x 400, 8-bit TIFF) organized into 16 experimental
  groups, and is intended for training and evaluating flagella
  recognition and segmentation models.
keywords:
  - Chlamydomonas reinhardtii
  - CC125
  - flagella
  - semantic segmentation
  - instance segmentation
  - microscopy
  - microneedle holding
  - deep learning
  - UESTC
